<title>UK: DePfa unit sets 250 million guilder bond. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>DePfa unit sets 250 million guilder bond. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    20.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p>(Corrects pay date from 28th March)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.20     SPREAD	+13.1 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
